    "id": "a021f32b-95b9-411c-9c4c-016f618eb1b6",
    "message": "All product is now in hand as of today. First testing round has gone out to Freedom via overnight shipping and will be in their hands Monday. Another 2 vials of each will be heading to BTLabs this coming week. Both labs have the Eloralintide standard to test against. Once testing is back (most likely Freedom will be first to arrive), shipping will commence!",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-03T20:28:48.884Z"
   },
   {
    "id": "635c1ff0-71d8-405e-903b-fe557437fca7",
    "message": "Update from the supplier:  Hello dear! First the Elora factory will deliver the goods to the warehouse on September 22nd. Then, I will send you the shipping pictures for delivery on September 23rd. On September 25th, I will send you the logistics form. You should receive the package around sep.29",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-22T16:09:19.356Z"
   },
