    "id": "21bc0e43-45c4-4de0-b11c-3c0ac2488f44",
    "message": "Order has been placed with the vendor and is expected to ship between Sept 8th and Sept 15th. Reopening for a few more people to join that were unable to during the migration of the site and upgrade to site security. This is not delaying the buy at all, just giving a more people the opportunity to join while we wait for shipping.",
